        "cooked": "<p>Hi all.</p>\n<p>I am a fan of both Sentinel Comics and <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Lego\">LEGOⓇ</a>.* Thus, it is only natural for me to combine the two. I am well aware that <a href=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/t/sentinels-of-the-multiverse-fan-art/6924/169\">others</a> have already done such things. I nonetheless wished to try my hand at it.</p>\n<p>To this end I have fashioned a number of Minifigure©™ versions of Sentinel Comics characters. I could not manage to make mine nearly as detailed or accurate as the afore-linked ones, though.</p>\n<p>I’ve already posted my Black Fist Minifigure in <a href=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/t/lego-sentinels-of-the-multiverse/14345\">another thread</a>, but it was quite an old one several posts long, so I thought I shouldn’t make folks wade through all that.</p>\n<p>I would have created more, but I had to pack up my bricks and probably won’t have access to them for some time.</p>\n<p>Anywho, here’s 3/5 of the Freedom Five:<br>\n<div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/original/2X/1/13bf9e424af9b77ddc174599becbdc5f74bceeb6.jpeg\" data-download-href=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/13bf9e424af9b77ddc174599becbdc5f74bceeb6\" title=\"Freedom &amp;#39;Figs\"><img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/1/13bf9e424af9b77ddc174599becbdc5f74bceeb6_2_499x375.jpeg\" alt=\"Freedom 'Figs\" data-base62-sha1=\"2OHBWFsv7DxxFI563zIzlhZSkYu\" width=\"499\" height=\"375\" srcset=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/1/13bf9e424af9b77ddc174599becbdc5f74bceeb6_2_499x375.jpeg, https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/1/13bf9e424af9b77ddc174599becbdc5f74bceeb6_2_748x562.jpeg 1.5x, https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/1/13bf9e424af9b77ddc174599becbdc5f74bceeb6_2_998x750.jpeg 2x\" data-small-upload=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/1/13bf9e424af9b77ddc174599becbdc5f74bceeb6_2_10x10.png\"><div class=\"meta\">\n<svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">Freedom &amp;#39;Figs</span><span class=\"informations\">1920×1440 155 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg>\n</div></a></div><br>\nAs you can see, The Wraith’s costume is kinda an eclectic mix of parts of all of her costumes. I did not have a purple torso, unfortunately. Also, Tyler Vance is currently without the Bunker Suit. And I know Tachyon’s hairdo is a bit strange, but I had to choose between accurate colour or accurate shape, and as you can see I chose colour.</p>\n<p>Next, their nefarious nemesis, complete with mechanical arm:<br>\n<div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/original/2X/a/aabc1129171eb7d2b7dcb8e0103971f7132f3a92.jpeg\" data-download-href=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/aabc1129171eb7d2b7dcb8e0103971f7132f3a92\" title=\"Baron Brick\"><img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/a/aabc1129171eb7d2b7dcb8e0103971f7132f3a92_2_499x375.jpeg\" alt=\"Baron Brick\" data-base62-sha1=\"omo6j4IpLcuqHZVMcNknR2AElIm\" width=\"499\" height=\"375\" srcset=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/a/aabc1129171eb7d2b7dcb8e0103971f7132f3a92_2_499x375.jpeg, https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/a/aabc1129171eb7d2b7dcb8e0103971f7132f3a92_2_748x562.jpeg 1.5x, https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/a/aabc1129171eb7d2b7dcb8e0103971f7132f3a92_2_998x750.jpeg 2x\" data-small-upload=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/a/aabc1129171eb7d2b7dcb8e0103971f7132f3a92_2_10x10.png\"><div class=\"meta\">\n<svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">Baron Brick</span><span class=\"informations\">1920×1440 158 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg>\n</div></a></div></p>\n<p>And here are a couple of other heroes:<br>\n<div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/original/2X/b/b1ce28f12e5967da5c9eb750c5770b2eefae1b52.jpeg\" data-download-href=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/b1ce28f12e5967da5c9eb750c5770b2eefae1b52\" title=\"Back Fist &amp;amp; Omnitron-X\"><img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/b/b1ce28f12e5967da5c9eb750c5770b2eefae1b52_2_499x375.jpeg\" alt=\"Back Fist &amp; Omnitron-X\" data-base62-sha1=\"pmWcT6gLaHXTgUA0z5O7ZAX8S7o\" width=\"499\" height=\"375\" srcset=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/b/b1ce28f12e5967da5c9eb750c5770b2eefae1b52_2_499x375.jpeg, https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/b/b1ce28f12e5967da5c9eb750c5770b2eefae1b52_2_748x562.jpeg 1.5x, https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/b/b1ce28f12e5967da5c9eb750c5770b2eefae1b52_2_998x750.jpeg 2x\" data-small-upload=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/b/b1ce28f12e5967da5c9eb750c5770b2eefae1b52_2_10x10.png\"><div class=\"meta\">\n<svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">Back Fist &amp;amp; Omnitron-X</span><span class=\"informations\">4032×3024 508 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg>\n</div></a></div></p>\n<p>And, lastly, here are Baron Blade with a ominous doomsday device controller, Black Fist wielding a bo staff, and Omni-X with an arm cannon thingie:<br>\n<div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/original/2X/3/3af06ca38ddeabd6e5bb83818585f809581d3da1.jpeg\" data-download-href=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/3af06ca38ddeabd6e5bb83818585f809581d3da1\" title=\"Minifigs with accessories\"><img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/3/3af06ca38ddeabd6e5bb83818585f809581d3da1_2_499x375.jpeg\" alt=\"Minifigs with accessories\" data-base62-sha1=\"8poNBG4k8OlVnQRr6Y2FRZ7oj6h\" width=\"499\" height=\"375\" srcset=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/3/3af06ca38ddeabd6e5bb83818585f809581d3da1_2_499x375.jpeg, https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/3/3af06ca38ddeabd6e5bb83818585f809581d3da1_2_748x562.jpeg 1.5x, https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/3/3af06ca38ddeabd6e5bb83818585f809581d3da1_2_998x750.jpeg 2x\" data-small-upload=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/3/3af06ca38ddeabd6e5bb83818585f809581d3da1_2_10x10.png\"><div class=\"meta\">\n<svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">Minifigs with accessories</span><span class=\"informations\">4032×3024 559 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg>\n</div></a></div></p>\n<p>Play well!</p>\n<p><em>(LEGO® is a trademark of the LEGO Group of companies which does not sponsor, authorize or endorse this post.)</em></p>\n<p><code>*</code>Yes, one is legally bound to refer to the company/product with the “Ⓡ.” See <a href=\"https://www.lego.com/en-us/legal/notices-and-policies/fair-play/\">here</a>.</p>",
